        <h3>11.4 难度曲线（前10财年）</h3>
        <div class="callout">
            <code>年度系数 = 1 + (0.12 × 财年号) / (1 + 0.04 × 财年号)</code>
        </div>
        <div class="table-wrap">
            <table>
